er wrapper could not be used because Docker is not installed in this environment, but the local `make NORM`, `robot convert`, and `robot reason` validations completed successfully.\n\n","files":[{"filePath":"/__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md","relativePath":"ISSUE_COMMENTS.md","type":"add","patch":"Index: /__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n===================================================================\n--- /__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n+++ /__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,1 @@\n+Added Southern tick-associated rash illness as `MONDO:7770018`; changes committed in PR #<NN>.\n","additions":1,"deletions":0},{"filePath":"/__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/PR_COMMENTS.md","relativePath":"PR_COMMENTS.md","type":"add","patch":"Index: /__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/PR_COMMENTS.md\n===================================================================\n--- /__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/PR_COMMENTS.md\n+++ /__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/PR_COMMENTS.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,23 @@\n+## Summary\n+\n+Added a new MONDO term for Southern tick-associated rash illness (`MONDO:7770018`) as a child of tick-borne infectious disease (`MONDO:0025294`).\n+\n+## Rationale\n+\n+The requested concept is supported by the cited publications and by equivalent external records in NCIT (`NCIT:C128427`) and SNOMED CT (`SCTID:444100007`). The term includes the requested exact synonyms `STARI` and `Masters disease`, equivalent xrefs, the requested issue tracker link, and a vector relationship to the lone star tick (`NCBITaxon:6943`).\n+\n+## Completed Checklist\n+\n+- Reviewed issue #9873 context.\n+- Checked for existing duplicate MONDO content using `obo-grep.pl`.\n+- Confirmed requested parent `MONDO:0025294` exists and is appropriate.\n+- Validated PMIDs `19522220`, `36116832`, and `40267428` through PubMe